## Architecture mapping (web → native)

- useTrip (GET /trips/{id})  → TripDetailPageClientFeed (Registration.DetailOperation = get_api_v1_trips_trip_id,
                              GET /trips/{trip_id}, path-param trip_id) — the single primary read; its failure
                              drives the page error state (web PageContainer error path; useTrip is 404-bound).
- PageContainer(title,subtitle,loading,error) → TripDetailPage.cs header (PageTitle + success-only Subhead) +
                              the loading shimmer / TsQueryError / TsEmptyState / content host, gated by the
                              TripDetailDisplay.Show{Loading,Error,Empty,Content} flags.
- StatCard ×4 (Grid cols 2/4) → TripDetailProjection.BuildStatCards → TripStatCardDisplay → View TsStatCard grid.
- GlassPanel + KVList (6 rows) → TripDetailProjection.BuildDetailRows → View TsGlassPanel + TsKVList.
- convertDistanceFromSI / KM_PER_MILE efficiency / formatCurrency → Core.Units UnitConverters.DistanceFromSi +
                              ScalarFormatters.FormatNumber/currency, applied ONLY at this display boundary; SI
                              (meters / watt-hours) is read straight from the wire (Phase-48 SI canonical).
- i18n t('trips.detail.*')   → ILocalizer.GetString with web key names verbatim (TripDetailStrings.Resolve).

