Every code-level gate is green: placeholder scan (0 placeholders), full-solution build (0 errors; TripDetailPage
code 0 warnings / 0 errors), format/lint (clean), the unit + projection suite (27566 passed / 0 failed, including
the 30 new TripDetailPageTests), and parity coverage (21/21 — the four headline stat cards Distance / Energy-Used /
Efficiency / Cost, the six-row detail GlassPanel, the loading / empty / error / success data states, and all 12
